ark for Audio-Video Generation. In\nProceedings of the IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition, 23345–23355.\nKinsler, L. E.; Frey, A. R.; Coppens, A. B.; and Sanders,\nJ. V. 2000. Fundamentals of Acoustics. John Wiley & Sons,\n4 edition. ISBN 9780471847892.\nLi, T.; Gururani, S.; Shih, K. J.; Bhatt, G.; Lee, S.-g.; Kong,\nZ.; Goel, A.; Anumanchipalli, G.; and Liu, M.-Y. 2026.\nBenchmarking Single-Factor Physical Video-to-Audio Generation. In Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF Conference on\nComputer Vision and Pattern Recognition, 1939–1949.\nOh, H.-B.; Takida, Y.; Uesaka, T.; Oh, T.-H.; and Mitsufuji,\nY. 2026. PAVAS: Physics-Aware Video-to-Audio Synthesis.\nIn Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer\nVision and Pattern Recognition, 14481–14491.\nPhysikalisch-Technische Bundesanstalt. n.d.\nThe\nRoom Acoustics Absorption Coefficient Database.\nhttps://www.ptb.de/cms/ptb/fachabteilungen/abt1/fb16/ag-163/absorption-coefficient-database.html. Accessed:\n2026-07-15.\nSchroeder, M. R. 1965. New Method of Measuring Reverberation Time. The Journal of the Acoustical Society of\nAmerica, 37(3): 409–412.\nSony; and Tampere University. 2023. Sony-TAu Realistic Spatial Soundscapes 2023. https://zenodo.org/records/\n7880637. Dataset record referenced by the local experimental report.\nXie, T.; Lei, W.; Jiang, K.; Huang, G.; Zhang, P.; Zhang,\nC.; Ma, F.; He, H.; Zhang, H.; He, J.; Wang, J.; Fang,\nL.; Gao, L.; Ablet, O.; Zhang, P.; Hu, R.; Li, S.; Lin, W.;\n\nFeng, X.; Yang, X.; Rong, Y.; Wang, Y.; Shao, Z.; Zhao,\nZ.; Li, C.; Yang, S.; Wang, W.; Yu, M.; Yu, D.; and Liu,\nL. 2025. PhyAVBench: A Challenging Audio PhysicsSensitivity Benchmark for Physically Grounded Text-toAudio-Video Generation. arXiv:2512.23994.\nZhou, J.; Guo, D.; Guo, R.; Mao, Y.; Hu, J.; Zhong, Y.;\nChang, X.; and Wang, M. 2025. Towards Open-Vocabulary\nAudio-Visual Event Localization. In Proceedings of the\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern\nRecognition, 8362–837